From a73649f1a347d24d784e416092c1ab4eb6a3dc38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:14:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(build): ship the examples directory in every release
 package

Add examples/ to the staged tree (xtask stage_list), the Linux, AppImage,
FreeBSD, macOS, Flatpak and AUR packagers, and the content checks of
release.yml and installer.ps1. A missing examples directory is an error.

Refs #2042

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
